OL,3,GNEWSAMan cautioned over Reform
OL,4,Aconference assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a caution by
OL,7,Fpolice following assaults on protesters
OL,8,Fat the Reform UK party conference in
OL,9,FBirmingham earlier this month.
OL,11,FFootage appeared to show protesters
OL,12,Fbeing manhandled by audience members as
OL,13,Fthey were thrown out. One woman had her
OL,14,Fhair pulled, and was was hit with a
OL,15,Fwalking stick.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Police said it was
OL,18,Finvestigating assaults on five people
OL,19,Fand two other men had been voluntarily
OL,20,Finterviewed, as inquiries continued.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
